// Moon surface definition (shared test system).
//
// M1 (World map and planet editor), 2026-10-10: the Moon moved from the retired
// library heightmap (`moon_highlands_a`) to the procedural crater fields that
// Rust used until M1. The airless-moon archetype (maria, Tier A craters)
// arrives in M8 (Variety).
